\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Behavioural outcomes of the three loop architectures on the $T=29$ cued change-detection task ($500$ fresh episodes each, sampled policy). The shared-memory closed loop (V1) is a calibrated, change-locked detector; the independent (V2) and swapped-routing (V3) configurations both collapse to never declaring a change. Each configuration differs from V1 in exactly one structural property.}}{6}{table.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:loopresults}{{1}{6}{Behavioural outcomes of the three loop architectures on the $T=29$ cued change-detection task ($500$ fresh episodes each, sampled policy). The shared-memory closed loop (V1) is a calibrated, change-locked detector; the independent (V2) and swapped-routing (V3) configurations both collapse to never declaring a change. Each configuration differs from V1 in exactly one structural property}{table.caption.6}{}}
